web SPA: vite+react19+ts-strict+zustand. every capable browser, capability-gated degradation (src/core/capabilities.ts: chromium/screenCapture/systemAudioCapture/camera/webCodecs/opfs/ios/appleWebKit). Apple WebKit: no tab/system audio; iOS: no screen capture at all (native-only via ReplayKit) — UI drops unsupported channels from the effective config, honest per-platform notice.
src/core = framework-free engine; src/app = react UI (imports @core/* only via module indexes). contracts: src/core/types.ts (authoritative).
capture: getDisplayMedia fired FIRST, synchronously inside the record-click gesture (WebKit drops transient activation on any prior await → no picker), granted cam/mic overlap the open picker, ungranted run after it. video=MediaRecorder webm on Chromium / mp4(h264+aac) on Apple WebKit (isTypeSupported-picked, '' = UA default; never force unsupported → threw on Safari); audio=AudioWorklet→WebCodecs opus→mediabunny webm (startOffset=first-sample wall). demux is container-agnostic (compose ALL_FORMATS) so mixed-format takes compose fine. durable OPFS writer worker for MediaRecorder path. no full-bleed screen preview while recording. 30min cap. ?synthetic=1 = generated streams.
store: OPFS blobs (blobStore + SyncAccessHandle durable worker) + IndexedDB metadata (recordingsRepo).
timeline: pure trim math, unit-tested. channel trims blank (no time shift); global trim = output bounds.
compose: mediabunny + WebCodecs. sample channels per frame -> canvas layout -> encode. mp4 avc+aac, fallback avc+opus, then vp9+opus webm. layout: 1080p30; screen letterboxed; cam PiP BR 24%w; audio-only=waveform. audio: Hermite resample to 48kHz, soft-limit, seam-safe 1s chunks.
share: saveToFile + ShareTarget list. cloud: supabase adapter behind CloudProvider iface (google oauth, private bucket, signed URL, quota+ttl); null when env unset. E2EE-compatible: provider never requires plaintext metadata beyond size/name.
analytics: event bus, console dev / noop prod.
UI flow: capture -> editor -> exporting -> share (zustand state machine, no router). editor preview = DOM-synced <video>s mirroring compositor layout via timeline fns.
